=2 Walkthrough
!Inner Horutoto Ruins-map1.jpg|right|Lily Tower Map
* Speak to any Windurstian {n:Gate Guard}, and accept the Mission.
** {n:Mokyokyo} - {z:Windurst Waters} (F-5)
** {n:Janshura-Rashura} - {z:Port Windurst} (B-5)
** {n:Rakoh Buuma} - {z:Windurst Woods} (K-10)
** {n:Zokima-Rokima} - {z:Windurst Walls} (H-7)
* Head for the {p:Orastery} in {z:Port Windurst}. Speak to {n:Hakkuru-Rinkuru} at (E-7) for a cutscene.
* Make your way to (J-7) in {z:East Sarutabaruta}. You're looking for a large stone tower.
** The Inner Horutoto Ruins {p:Survival Guide} places you at the right tower if you have it unlocked already.
* **(Optional):** Speak to {n:Sama Gohjima} near the entrance for some dialogue.
* Head down the stairs to the {z:Inner Horutoto Ruins}.
* Inside, you'll be in the **Lily Tower** on Map 1. Go down the stairs in to the main room.
* Run to the other side, and look for the **Cracked Wall**, around (H-9). Pass through it and go left.
* Check the **Gate: Magical Gizmo** at (I-9) for a cutscene with the Minister.
* Now, head back out and check the six different **Ancient Magical Gizmos** until you are given the {@k} {k:Cracked Mana Orb}. It will be at a random Gizmo.
* Head back to {n:Hakkuru-Rinkuru} and speak with him to finish the Mission.

